flowchart TD
    conversation[1. Conversation grows<br/>Raw JSONL records every turn]
    checkpoint[2. Create a checkpoint<br/>The examiner turns only the new interval into a checkpoint]
    publish[3. Publish the new memory<br/>The next safe prompt loads it]
    continue[4. A later interval creates checkpoint 4<br/>The staged memory keeps chronological order]
    threshold[5. Memory reaches 80%<br/>Select the oldest legal whole-record prefix]
    consolidate[6. Consolidate the old prefix<br/>Keep recent checkpoints exact]
    rolled[7. Continue with rolled memory<br/>Consolidated base + exact recent checkpoints]
    canonical[(Raw session JSONL remains complete)]

    conversation --> checkpoint
    checkpoint --> publish
    publish --> continue
    continue --> threshold
    threshold --> consolidate
    consolidate --> rolled
    rolled -. later conversation repeats the sequence .-> continue
    conversation -. canonical history .-> canonical
    rolled -. rebuild source remains available .-> canonical
